# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit real settings files. Only .env.example belongs in git.
# The glob is deliberately wide: this project has already produced .env, a
# dot-less "env" (cPanel File Manager strips the dot), and an "api.env".
# Matching only the names we have seen would miss the next variant.
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
env
env.*
!env.example
*env.bak

# ── Build output that carries secrets ─────────────────────
# The upload zips bundle server/env. Do not commit them.
dist/

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── Runtime / uploads ─────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
deploy/public/uploads/
godaddy-upload/public/uploads/

# ── OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.claude/
# Finder duplicates: "name 2.png". Space-then-digit, so real
# names like hero-2.png are unaffected.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*

# Working notes, not part of the codebase.
SESSION-SUMMARY.md
